{"suttaId":"an4.40","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-iv","vriCode":"s0402m3.mul","paras":[437,452],"vripara":"40"},"segments":{"an4.40:0.3":"Udāyīsuttaṃ","an4.40:1.1":"Atha kho udāyī [udāyi (sabbattha)] brāhmaṇo yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavatā … pe … ekamantaṃ nisinno kho udāyī brāhmaṇo bhagavantaṃ etadavoca –","an4.40:1.2":"“bhavampi no gotamo yaññaṃ vaṇṇetī”ti?","an4.40:1.3":"“Na kho ahaṃ, brāhmaṇa, sabbaṃ yaññaṃ vaṇṇemi;","an4.40:1.4":"na panāhaṃ, brāhmaṇa, sabbaṃ yaññaṃ na vaṇṇemi.","an4.40:1.5":"Yathārūpe kho, brāhmaṇa, yaññe gāvo haññanti, ajeḷakā haññanti, kukkuṭasūkarā haññanti, vividhā pāṇā saṅghātaṃ āpajjanti;","an4.40:1.6":"evarūpaṃ kho ahaṃ, brāhmaṇa, sārambhaṃ yaññaṃ na vaṇṇemi.","an4.40:1.7":"Taṃ kissa hetu?","an4.40:1.8":"Evarūpañhi, brāhmaṇa, sārambhaṃ yaññaṃ na upasaṅkamanti arahanto vā arahattamaggaṃ vā samāpannā.","an4.40:2.1":"“Yathārūpe ca kho, brāhmaṇa, yaññe neva gāvo haññanti, na ajeḷakā haññanti, na kukkuṭasūkarā haññanti, na vividhā pāṇā saṅghātaṃ āpajjanti;","an4.40:2.2":"evarūpaṃ kho ahaṃ, brāhmaṇa, nirārambhaṃ yaññaṃ vaṇṇemi, yadidaṃ niccadānaṃ anukulayaññaṃ.","an4.40:2.3":"Taṃ kissa hetu?","an4.40:2.4":"Evarūpañhi, brāhmaṇa, nirārambhaṃ yaññaṃ upasaṅkamanti arahanto vā arahattamaggaṃ vā samāpannā”ti.","an4.40:3.1":"“Abhisaṅkhataṃ nirārambhaṃ,","an4.40:3.2":"yaññaṃ kālena kappiyaṃ;","an4.40:3.3":"Tādisaṃ upasaṃyanti,","an4.40:3.4":"saññatā brahmacārayo.","an4.40:4.1":"“Vivaṭacchadā [vivattacchadā (sī. pī.), vivaṭṭacchadā (ka.)] ye loke,","an4.40:4.2":"vītivattā kulaṃ gatiṃ;","an4.40:4.3":"Yaññametaṃ pasaṃsanti,","an4.40:4.4":"buddhā yaññassa [puññassa (syā. kaṃ. pī.)] kovidā.","an4.40:5.1":"“Yaññe vā yadi vā saddhe,","an4.40:5.2":"habyaṃ [havyaṃ (sī. pī.), huññaṃ (syā. kaṃ.)] katvā yathārahaṃ;","an4.40:5.3":"Pasannacitto yajati [pasannacittā yajanti (ka.)],","an4.40:5.4":"sukhette brahmacārisu.","an4.40:6.1":"“Suhutaṃ suyiṭṭhaṃ suppattaṃ [sampattaṃ (syā. kaṃ. ka.)],","an4.40:6.2":"dakkhiṇeyyesu yaṃ kataṃ;","an4.40:6.3":"Yañño ca vipulo hoti,","an4.40:6.4":"pasīdanti ca devatā.","an4.40:7.1":"“Evaṃ [etaṃ (ka.) a. ni.6.37] yajitvā medhāvī,","an4.40:7.2":"saddho muttena cetasā;","an4.40:7.3":"Abyābajjhaṃ sukhaṃ lokaṃ,","an4.40:7.4":"paṇḍito upapajjatī”ti.","an4.40:7.5":"dasamaṃ;","an4.40:7.6":"Cakkavaggo catuttho.","an4.40:8.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","an4.40:8.1":"Cakko saṅgaho sīho,","an4.40:8.2":"pasādo vassakārena pañcamaṃ;","an4.40:8.3":"Doṇo aparihāniyo patilīno,","an4.40:8.4":"ujjayo udāyinā te dasāti."},"unsure":[],"attha":{"book":"Mp-iv","bookName":"Catukkanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0402a.att","from":1225,"to":1225,"paras":[{"para":1225,"vripara":"40","refs":["an4.40:3","an4.40:4","an4.40:5","an4.40:6","an4.40:7"],"lines":["Dasame <b>abhisaṅkhatan</b>ti rāsikataṃ.","<b>Nirārambhan</b>ti pāṇasamārambharahitaṃ.","<b>Yaññan</b>ti deyyadhammaṃ.","Tañhi yajitabbattā yaññanti vuccati.","<b>Kālenā</b>ti yuttappattakālena.","<b>Upasaṃyantī</b>ti upagacchanti.","<b>Kulaṃ gatin</b>ti vaṭṭakulañceva vaṭṭagatiñca atikkantā.","<b>Yaññassa kovidā</b>ti catubhūmakayaññe kusalā.","<b>Yaññe</b>ti pakatidāne.","<b>Saddhe</b>ti matakadāne.","<b>Habyaṃ katvā</b>ti hunitabbaṃ deyyadhammaṃ upakappetvā.","<b>Sukhette brahmacārisū</b>ti brahmacārisaṅkhāte sukhettamhīti attho.","<b>Suppattan</b>ti suṭṭhu pattaṃ.","<b>Dakkhiṇeyyesu yaṃ katan</b>ti yaṃ dakkhiṇāya anucchavikesu upakappitaṃ, taṃ suhutaṃ suyiṭṭhaṃ suppattanti attho.","<b>Saddho</b>ti buddhadhammasaṅghaguṇānaṃ saddahanatāya saddho.","<b>Muttena cetasā</b>ti vissaṭṭhena cittena.","Imināssa muttacāgaṃ dīpetīti."],"lineRefs":[["an4.40:3"],["an4.40:3"],["an4.40:3"],["an4.40:3"],["an4.40:3"],["an4.40:3"],["an4.40:4"],["an4.40:4"],["an4.40:4"],["an4.40:5"],["an4.40:5"],["an4.40:5"],["an4.40:6"],["an4.40:6"],["an4.40:7"],["an4.40:7"],["an4.40:7"]]}],"wordLinks":[["an4.40:3.1","abhisaṅkhataṃ",0,0],["an4.40:3.1","nirārambhaṃ",0,1],["an4.40:3.1","yaññaṃ",0,2],["an4.40:3.1","kālenā",0,4],["an4.40:3.3","upasaṃyantī",0,5],["an4.40:4.1","kulaṃ gatiṃ",0,6],["an4.40:4.3","yaññassa kovidā",0,7],["an4.40:4.3","yaññe",0,8],["an4.40:5.1","saddhe",0,9],["an4.40:5.1","habyaṃ katvā",0,10],["an4.40:5.3","sukhette brahmacārisū",0,11],["an4.40:6.1","suppattaṃ",0,12],["an4.40:6.1","dakkhiṇeyyesu yaṃ kataṃ",0,13],["an4.40:7.1","saddho",0,14],["an4.40:7.1","muttena cetasā",0,15]],"before":[{"para":1224,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Udāyisuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]}]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-iv","bookName":"Catukkanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0402t.tik","from":1402,"to":1402,"paras":[{"para":1402,"vripara":"40","refs":["an4.40:7"],"lines":["Dasame <b>pāṇasamārambharahitan</b>ti pāṇaghātarahitaṃ.","<b>Abyābajjhaṃ sukhaṃ lokaṃ, paṇḍito upapajjatī</b>ti kāmacchandādibyāpādavirahitattā abyābajjhaṃ niddukkhaṃ.","Parapīḷābhāve pana vattabbaṃ natthi.","Jhānasamāpattivasena sukhabahulattā sukhaṃ ekantasukhaṃ brahmalokaṃ jhānapuññena, itarapuññena pana tadaññasampattibhavasaṅkhātaṃ sukhaṃ lokaṃ paṇḍito sappañño upeti.","Sesaṃ uttānameva."],"lineRefs":[["an4.40:7"],["an4.40:7"],["an4.40:7"],["an4.40:7"],["an4.40:7"]]}],"wordLinks":[["an4.40:7.3","abyābajjhaṃ sukhaṃ lokaṃ paṇḍito upapajjatī",0,1]],"before":[{"para":1400,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ujjayasuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1401,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Udāyisuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]}]},"tika2":null}
